flowchart TD
    A[User message] --> B{Need real-time listing or booking action?}
    B -->|No| C[Baseline chatbot path]
    C --> D[General advice / static knowledge answer]
    B -->|Yes| E{Enough required info?}
    E -->|No| F[Ask follow-up question]
    E -->|Yes| G[ReAct agent path]
    G --> H[Thought]
    H --> I[Action: call supported tool]
    I --> J[Observation]
    J --> K{Done?}
    K -->|No| H
    K -->|Yes| L[Final Answer]
    I --> M{Tool error?}
    M -->|Yes| N[Safe fallback / explain error]
    H --> O{Exceeded MAX_ITERATIONS or invalid loop?}
    O -->|Yes| P[Guardrail stop]
